{"unit_id":"greatyao__dsh-connect-cursor#feature-1","repo":"greatyao/dsh-connect-cursor","commit":"d7c9c7e7acc19dfb8b992f8232c61d0c7f056753","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-connect-cursor 的功能「模型目录发现」：插件注册模型发现回调，从 Cursor AvailableModels 获取账号可用目录，过滤隐藏模型后交给 DSH 选择器，并附上名称、上下文窗口和输入模态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:42-53","lib/models.js:141-160"]}
{"unit_id":"greatyao__dsh-connect-cursor#feature-2","repo":"greatyao/dsh-connect-cursor","commit":"d7c9c7e7acc19dfb8b992f8232c61d0c7f056753","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-connect-cursor 的功能「流式模型生成」：DSH 的消息、模型参数和工具定义会转换为 Cursor AgentService Run 请求；响应中的文本、思考和工具调用增量被转换为 DSH 流块。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/adapter.js:274-345","lib/session.js:236-319"]}
{"unit_id":"greatyao__dsh-connect-cursor#feature-3","repo":"greatyao/dsh-connect-cursor","commit":"d7c9c7e7acc19dfb8b992f8232c61d0c7f056753","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-connect-cursor 的功能「凭据解析」：插件按优先级读取环境令牌、桌面 state.vscdb、CLI auth.json 或可选 API key，并检查令牌有效期；桌面数据库以只读方式打开。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/auth.js:59-79","lib/auth.js:112-167"]}
{"unit_id":"greatyao__dsh-connect-cursor#feature-4","repo":"greatyao/dsh-connect-cursor","commit":"d7c9c7e7acc19dfb8b992f8232c61d0c7f056753","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-connect-cursor 的功能「模型别名和参数解析」：模型解析器支持目录别名、variant slug、方括号参数和常见型号别名，并为 Run 请求选择默认 variant；无法解析的显式型号会返回错误。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/models.js:206-283","lib/models.js:300-337"]}
